#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can enable PEC  the following ways:\n"
"    - The [Qiskit Mitigation](/addons/qiskit-mitigation) addon for Qiskit\n"
"    - The [`pec_mitigation` option](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-resilience-options#pec_mitigation) if using IBM Quantum Estimator\n"
msgstr ""
"PEC můžeš zapnout těmito způsoby:\n"
"    - Doplněk [Qiskit Mitigation](/addons/qiskit-mitigation) pro Qiskit\n"
"    - [Volba `pec_mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-resilience-options#pec_mitigation) při použití IBM Quantum Estimator\n"

